<h2>Why This Matters</h2>

<p>
    Understanding these concepts helps you:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Choose the right tool</strong> – Use forms for documents that need editing, attachments for completed documents, and file links for files on your computer</li>
    <li><strong>Work more efficiently</strong> – Agents can automate repetitive tasks, saving you time</li>
    <li><strong>Keep things organized</strong> – Tasks keep work connected to the right renewal or proposal</li>
    <li><strong>Access files correctly</strong> – Know whether something will open in a browser or in a local application</li>
</ul>

